<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-Hant">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>康軒七年級｜四種讀書的方法 測驗與重點複習</title>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Noto+Sans+TC:wght@300;400;500;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
:root{--bg:#1C1B1A;--tab:#322E2B;--tt:#D3BC8E;--gold:#ECC066;--gl:#D9AE4E;--jade:#F5F3ED;--pale:#EFECE3;--board:#E4DFD1;--ink:#2D2B2A;--soft:#6B645B;--red:#B3261E}
*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
body{background:var(--bg);color:var(--jade);font-family:"Noto Sans TC","jf-openhuninn-2.0","jf open 粉圓體","Microsoft JhengHei",sans-serif;line-height:1.7}
button{font:inherit;cursor:pointer;border:0;color:inherit}
a{color:var(--tt)}
.top{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px 18px;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:10px 18px;background:#262321;border-bottom:1px solid var(--gl);position:sticky;top:0;z-index:5}
.top h1{font-size:1.15rem;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:.15em;color:var(--gold)}
.tb2{display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.b{background:var(--tab);color:var(--tt);padding:7px 14px;font-size:.88rem;letter-spacing:.06em;clip-path:polygon(8px 0,100% 0,100% calc(100% - 8px),calc(100% - 8px) 100%,0 100%,0 8px)}
.b:hover{filter:brightness(1.3)}.b.on{background:var(--gold);color:var(--ink)}
.b.g{background:#2F3B39;color:#BCD3CA}.b.r{background:#3E2B2B;color:#EBC9BE}
.wrap{max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto;padding:16px 14px 60px}
.note{color:rgba(245,243,237,.75);font-size:1rem;margin-bottom:12px}
.rc{background:var(--board);color:var(--ink);border:1px solid var(--gl);padding:20px 24px;margin-bottom:18px;font-size:1.3rem}
.rc .tp{font-size:1.35rem;line-height:1.75}
.rc .tp table{font-size:1.3rem;margin:8px 0 10px}
.rc .tp table{table-layout:fixed}.rc .tp th:nth-child(1){width:15%}.rc .tp th:nth-child(2){width:18%}.rc .tp .tx th:nth-child(4){width:30%}.rc .tp .tx td{font-size:1.25rem}.rc .tp .tx .vw{font-size:1.35rem}
.rc .tp td,.rc .tp th{padding:7px 14px}
.rc .tp .grp{margin-bottom:22px}
.rc .tp .zy,.rc .tp .zy5,.rc .tp .zy6{line-height:2;white-space:normal;font-size:1.35rem}
.rc .tp .bank,.rc .tp .poem,.rc .tp .qs,.rc .tp .op{font-size:1.25rem}
.rc .tp .poem{padding:8px 14px}
.rc .tp .qs{padding:4px 12px}
.rc .tp .it{padding:4px 6px;margin-bottom:4px}
.rc .tp .it.open .rv.ex2{font-size:1.2rem;padding:6px 12px;margin:4px 0 8px}
.rc .tp .g2i{gap:4px 24px}
.rc .tp .sq,.rc .tp .bk{font-size:1.2rem}
.sh{font-size:1.6rem;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:.1em;cursor:pointer;display:flex;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px 14px;margin-bottom:6px}
.sh small{font-size:1.05rem;font-weight:400;color:var(--soft);letter-spacing:0}
.tipb{background:#FFF3B0;border:1px solid #E0C34A;padding:3px 12px;font-size:.85rem;color:var(--ink)}
.tip{background:#FFF8D6;border-left:4px solid var(--gl);padding:10px 16px;margin:6px 0 14px;font-size:1.2rem}
.rc .tip{display:block}.sx .tip{display:none}.sx .tip.on{display:block}
.flg{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(250px,1fr));gap:14px}
.fl{perspective:900px;height:170px;cursor:pointer}
.fi{position:relative;height:100%;transition:transform .3s;transform-style:preserve-3d}
.fl.on .fi{transform:rotateY(180deg)}
.ff,.fb{position:absolute;inset:0;backface-visibility:hidden;padding:12px;display:grid;place-items:center;text-align:center;border:1px solid var(--gl);overflow:auto}
.ff{background:#E9DDC5;color:#3B2F22;font-size:1.6rem;line-height:1.5}
.fb{background:var(--jade);color:var(--ink);transform:rotateY(180deg);font-size:1.25rem;line-height:1.55}
.fb b{font-size:1.8rem;color:#8B3A2E;display:block}
.nb{position:absolute;top:5px;left:8px;font-size:.95rem;opacity:.8}
.pv{padding:14px;overflow:auto}
#paper.full{background:var(--bg)}
#paper:fullscreen{overflow:auto;background:#1C1B1A;padding:10px}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.fi{transition:none}}
</style>
<style id="tcss"></style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="top">
  <h1>〈四種讀書的方法〉測驗・重點複習</h1>
  <div class="tb2" id="tabs"></div>
  <div class="tb2" id="acts"></div>
</div>
<div class="wrap">
  <p class="note" id="note"></p>
  <div id="review"></div>
  <div id="paper" class="live" hidden></div>
</div>
